1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 10=

4
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:54,560
Honey, I had such a great time today.

5
00:00:54,799 --> 00:00:55,479
I'm tired.

6
00:00:55,479 --> 00:00:56,600
I'm going to sleep first.

7
00:00:56,600 --> 00:00:58,320
Get some rest, babe.

8
00:00:58,399 --> 00:00:59,479
I'll go to bed later.

9
00:01:06,319 --> 00:01:08,319
(The bottle with the increased
dosage is empty.)

10
00:01:08,760 --> 00:01:10,680
(Su Qinglan is definitely going to die.)

11
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,920
(But where is the body?)

12
00:01:27,439 --> 00:01:28,599
(Zhao Ke?)

13
00:01:29,200 --> 00:01:30,680
(She's the one who saved her.)

14
00:01:31,519 --> 00:01:33,719
(This woman knows Su Qinglan.)

15
00:01:34,879 --> 00:01:36,680
(What exactly is their relationship?)

16
00:01:37,439 --> 00:01:38,239
(No.)

17
00:01:38,760 --> 00:01:40,000
(I need to find out.)

18
00:01:42,680 --> 00:01:47,320
(Silence; Operating Room Area;
No Entry for Visitors)

19
00:01:47,879 --> 00:01:48,920
Hey. Doctor.

20
00:01:48,920 --> 00:01:50,519
How is she doing now?

21
00:01:50,680 --> 00:01:52,799
The patient developed complications
after a kidney transplant.

22
00:01:52,799 --> 00:01:54,079
She needs another surgery.

23
00:01:54,439 --> 00:01:55,359
Complications?

24
00:01:55,360 --> 00:01:59,120
(Silence; Operating Room Area;
No Entry for Visitors)

25
00:01:59,120 --> 00:02:02,280
(Silence)

26
00:02:10,400 --> 00:02:11,719
Zhao Ke.

27
00:02:11,719 --> 00:02:12,960
What are you trying to do?

28
00:02:12,960 --> 00:02:14,199
What do you mean?

29
00:02:14,199 --> 00:02:15,759
Ms. Su passed out...

30
00:02:19,800 --> 00:02:21,120
Try that again,

31
00:02:21,560 --> 00:02:22,719
and I'll sue you.

32
00:02:23,159 --> 00:02:24,800
I'm the one who should sue you.

33
00:02:25,400 --> 00:02:27,719
You showed up at my house
without permission.

34
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:30,960
That's trespassing.

35
00:02:31,280 --> 00:02:33,879
Ms. Su called me and asked me to come.

36
00:02:34,000 --> 00:02:35,159
Aren't you good at investigating?

37
00:02:35,159 --> 00:02:36,000
Go ahead and check.

38
00:02:37,719 --> 00:02:38,759
Staring at me won't change anything.

39
00:02:38,759 --> 00:02:40,000
I don't know what she wanted to tell me.

40
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,919
She was already unconscious
when I arrived.

41
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,159
Wait.

42
00:02:46,759 --> 00:02:47,520
I told you before.

43
00:02:47,919 --> 00:02:48,639
A kiss, a hug,

44
00:02:49,000 --> 00:02:50,039
or spending the night with me

45
00:02:50,479 --> 00:02:51,840
all come with a price.

46
00:02:52,360 --> 00:02:53,199
Mr. Zhang,

47
00:02:53,599 --> 00:02:54,439
are you trying to get out of paying?

48
00:02:56,000 --> 00:02:57,879
At first, I suspected
you were Jiang Lai.

49
00:02:58,319 --> 00:02:59,120
But now...

50
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:01,960
Jiang Lai was never this shameless.

51
00:03:02,960 --> 00:03:03,759
But

52
00:03:04,840 --> 00:03:05,759
I like it.

53
00:03:07,319 --> 00:03:08,400
If you want money,

54
00:03:09,719 --> 00:03:10,599
come to me.

55
00:03:31,599 --> 00:03:32,479
What?

56
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:33,680
(Ms. Lin.)

57
00:03:33,680 --> 00:03:35,120
(Ms. Su has been rushed
to the hospital.)

58
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:36,360
(Please come to the hospital
right away.)

59
00:03:37,319 --> 00:03:38,680
What happened to my mother?

60
00:03:45,400 --> 00:03:45,960
Ms. Lin.

61
00:03:45,960 --> 00:03:47,000
You can't go in right now.

62
00:03:47,759 --> 00:03:48,439
Move!

63
00:03:48,599 --> 00:03:49,960
Let's wait until the doctor comes out,
alright?

64
00:03:50,879 --> 00:03:51,520
But...

65
00:03:51,719 --> 00:03:52,639
I'll wait with you.

66
00:03:55,759 --> 00:03:57,719
Mom takes her medicine
on time every day.

67
00:03:58,120 --> 00:04:00,439
How could she suddenly
have a rejection reaction?

68
00:04:04,039 --> 00:04:06,439
Doctor, how is my mother?

69
00:04:06,439 --> 00:04:07,840
Ms. Su is out of danger.

70
00:04:07,840 --> 00:04:08,719
But...

71
00:04:09,199 --> 00:04:09,960
But what?

72
00:04:09,960 --> 00:04:11,199
Tell me!

73
00:04:11,199 --> 00:04:12,800
She's fallen into a coma.

74
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:14,719
I can't say when she'll wake up.

75
00:04:14,719 --> 00:04:16,279
She may never wake up.

76
00:04:19,199 --> 00:04:20,000
Haotian,

77
00:04:20,439 --> 00:04:22,480
you found the kidney for Mom.

78
00:04:22,480 --> 00:04:23,560
You must have a way to save her.

79
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,079
Right?

80
00:04:24,319 --> 00:04:24,839
Baby.

81
00:04:24,839 --> 00:04:25,720
I'm begging you.

82
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,680
Please save my mom.

83
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,040
I want to save your mother.

84
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:30,720
But your mother never liked me.

85
00:04:31,279 --> 00:04:33,160
She even forced me to sign
a prenuptial agreement.

86
00:04:33,879 --> 00:04:35,079
You know she doesn't trust me.

87
00:04:35,079 --> 00:04:36,319
She has always doubted me.

88
00:04:36,319 --> 00:04:37,920
It's just a stupid agreement.

89
00:04:38,439 --> 00:04:39,680
I'll go back right now.

90
00:04:40,040 --> 00:04:41,319
Even if I have to blow open the safe,

91
00:04:41,319 --> 00:04:42,959
I'll get that agreement.

92
00:04:45,160 --> 00:04:45,720
Baby.

93
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:52,879
(This time, without your mom standing
in the way,)

94
00:04:53,399 --> 00:04:55,920
(I believe you'll definitely
get the prenuptial agreement.)

95
00:04:57,560 --> 00:04:59,639
(You can do it, baby.)

96
00:05:11,199 --> 00:05:12,759
(Zhang Haotian used my kidney)

97
00:05:12,759 --> 00:05:14,360
(to gain Su Qinglan's trust.)

98
00:05:16,639 --> 00:05:18,480
(Now, for the sake of revenge,)

99
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:21,240
(I've learned to play along
the same way he did.)

100
00:05:21,240 --> 00:05:24,000
♪Where life and death no longer part us♪

101
00:05:24,000 --> 00:05:26,800
(Using Zhao Ke's identity,
I pretend to be greedy and frivolous)

102
00:05:27,240 --> 00:05:28,800
(to gain Zhang Haotian's trust.)

103
00:05:29,640 --> 00:05:32,279
♪Lost deep within the whirlpool
of secrets♪

104
00:05:32,279 --> 00:05:33,000
(Today,)

105
00:05:34,279 --> 00:05:36,120
(when I asked Zhang Haotian for money,)

106
00:05:36,399 --> 00:05:37,959
(the way I acted,)

107
00:05:38,839 --> 00:05:40,759
(I truly felt)

108
00:05:41,240 --> 00:05:42,399
(that I was beyond saving.)

109
00:05:45,840 --> 00:05:50,480
♪Love has faded away, while
hatred continues to spread♪

110
00:05:54,600 --> 00:05:56,720
(Jiang Lai, who once loved dance
with all her heart,)

111
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,920
(pure and innocent,)

112
00:05:59,759 --> 00:06:01,160
(was pushed to the edge of a cliff,)

113
00:06:01,160 --> 00:06:02,319
(with nowhere left to turn.)

114
00:06:05,600 --> 00:06:06,639
(I feel)

115
00:06:07,120 --> 00:06:08,360
(I'm about to break.)

116
00:06:09,000 --> 00:06:10,560
(It's time for me to step forward,)

117
00:06:10,839 --> 00:06:13,279
(for Jiang Lai, and for myself,)

118
00:06:13,879 --> 00:06:15,720
(and reclaim the justice
we've been denied for so long.)

119
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:18,240
♪Awaken♪

120
00:06:18,480 --> 00:06:20,720
♪Between the dreams we leave behind♪

121
00:06:20,920 --> 00:06:22,560
♪Draw a circle of falling flowers♪

122
00:06:22,680 --> 00:06:24,600
♪And write your verses down♪

123
00:06:24,880 --> 00:06:26,640
♪Ripples bloom within my heart♪

124
00:06:26,760 --> 00:06:28,680
♪Only because of you♪

125
00:06:28,880 --> 00:06:30,800
♪Between each move upon the chessboard♪

126
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,720
♪Lies a cruel trial♪

127
00:06:34,120 --> 00:06:35,639
I thought that for revenge,

128
00:06:36,399 --> 00:06:37,879
I could do anything.

129
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:39,480
But then I realized

130
00:06:41,920 --> 00:06:43,720
I just couldn't bring myself to do it.

131
00:06:45,000 --> 00:06:47,519
♪For this life, I trade one breath
for a lifetime of fate♪

132
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:48,639
Do you want to stop?

133
00:06:49,960 --> 00:06:54,280
♪Promise you a lifetime of protection♪

134
00:06:56,839 --> 00:06:58,120
Don't let revenge

135
00:06:58,959 --> 00:07:00,399
destroy your life.

136
00:07:02,720 --> 00:07:03,800
Go chase your dreams.

137
00:07:06,920 --> 00:07:08,199
Leave everything else

138
00:07:10,120 --> 00:07:11,160
to me.

139
00:07:19,720 --> 00:07:22,880
♪Lost deep within the whirlpool
of secrets♪

140
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:26,960
♪Crossing through the murk
of the world and hearts♪

141
00:07:27,640 --> 00:07:30,400
♪Reborn from the ashes,
I craft my grand design♪

142
00:07:30,520 --> 00:07:32,760
♪No one can ever break it now♪

143
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:40,240
♪Love has faded away, while
hatred continues to spread♪

144
00:07:43,600 --> 00:07:45,880
♪Defying fate's arrangements♪

145
00:07:46,120 --> 00:07:48,720
♪Following only the will
within my heart♪

146
00:07:50,519 --> 00:07:51,920
Su Qinglan is still alive.

147
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,319
That shouldn't be possible.

148
00:07:54,279 --> 00:07:55,480
Something went wrong.

149
00:07:55,480 --> 00:07:56,480
But it's fine.

150
00:07:56,839 --> 00:07:58,040
Lin Lulu has always lived

151
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,480
under Su Qinglan's protection.

152
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,519
Now that Su Qinglan has fallen,

153
00:08:03,319 --> 00:08:05,040
she has suddenly lost the person
she relies on.

154
00:08:05,720 --> 00:08:06,839
That makes her even easier
to manipulate.

155
00:08:09,360 --> 00:08:11,079
Alright then.

156
00:08:24,240 --> 00:08:26,639
(Why did Su Qinglan call Zhao Ke?)

157
00:08:32,799 --> 00:08:33,720
Mom.

158
00:08:39,799 --> 00:08:40,559
Mom.

159
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:42,799
Haotian drove us here.

160
00:08:42,919 --> 00:08:45,399
Please let him join us for the event.

161
00:08:45,519 --> 00:08:46,399
Okay?

162
00:08:47,559 --> 00:08:49,120
Please?

163
00:08:49,759 --> 00:08:50,960
That's not part of the plan.

164
00:08:54,799 --> 00:08:56,200
(That old woman must have found out)

165
00:08:56,200 --> 00:08:57,600
(about Zhao Ke seducing me.)

166
00:08:57,960 --> 00:08:59,279
(She's trying to add more pressure)

167
00:08:59,480 --> 00:09:01,360
(and make the evidence
of my affair undeniable,)

168
00:09:01,799 --> 00:09:03,279
(so Lin Lulu will finally realize
the truth)

169
00:09:03,600 --> 00:09:04,799
(and divorce me.)

170
00:09:06,200 --> 00:09:09,200
(Well, your plan is about to fail.)

171
00:09:11,160 --> 00:09:13,200
(Hiding the Strength)

172
00:09:13,960 --> 00:09:17,840
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

173
00:09:17,920 --> 00:09:20,720
♪I should forget you♪

174
00:09:21,560 --> 00:09:25,960
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

175
00:09:26,400 --> 00:09:27,920
♪To carry on♪

176
00:09:28,800 --> 00:09:33,160
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

177
00:09:33,920 --> 00:09:36,840
♪You no longer have the strength♪

178
00:09:38,280 --> 00:09:41,640
♪You want me to go there for you♪

179
00:09:42,480 --> 00:09:47,800
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

180
00:09:48,120 --> 00:09:51,960
♪Your freedom♪

181
00:09:52,640 --> 00:09:57,440
♪Has become my cage♪

182
00:09:58,160 --> 00:10:04,240
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

183
00:10:04,560 --> 00:10:10,360
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

184
00:10:11,680 --> 00:10:17,760
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

185
00:10:17,800 --> 00:10:20,640
♪You told me♪

186
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:25,800
♪I would shine like a star♪

187
00:10:26,880 --> 00:10:30,840
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

188
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:34,480
♪How to live without you♪

189
00:10:34,720 --> 00:10:38,880
♪I look up♪

190
00:10:38,880 --> 00:10:41,640
♪The starry sky♪

191
00:10:41,960 --> 00:10:45,440
♪So hazy and blurred♪
